msgid "- Check share permissions (read/write)\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Sjekk deletillatelser (lese/skrive)\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Ensure NAS is powered on and accessible\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Sørg for at NAS er slått på og tilgjengelig\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Enter server IP, share name, username and password\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Skriv inn server-IP, delenavn, brukernavn og passord\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Go to Main Menu > Setup > System > Storage Manager\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Gå til Hovedmeny > Oppsett > System > Lagringsbehandling\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- HDD backups: Stored in /media/hdd/backup\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- HDD-sikkerhetskopier: Lagret i /media/hdd/backup\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Keep regular backups of your system\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Ta regelmessige sikkerhetskopier av systemet ditt\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- NET backups: Require mounted CIFS/NFS share with write permissions\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- NET-sikkerhetskopier: Krev montert CIFS/NFS-deling med skriverettigheter\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Never interrupt backup/restore processes\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Avbryt aldri sikkerhetskopierings-/gjenopprettingsprosesser\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Restore: Works from HDD, USB, NET or MMC storage\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Gjenopprett: Fungerer fra HDD, USB, NET eller MMC-lagring\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Select 'Network Storage' and add your NAS/SMB share\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Velg 'Nettverkslagring' og legg til NAS/SMB-andelen din\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Test connection with ping command\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Test tilkobling med ping-kommando\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- USB backups: Require FAT32-formatted drive with 'backupstick' file\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- USB-sikkerhetskopier: Krever FAT32-formatert stasjon med 'backupstick'-fil\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Use quality USB drives for recovery sticks\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Bruk USB-stasjoner av høy kvalitet for gjenopprettingspinner\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Verify username/password are correct\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Bekreft at brukernavn/passord er riktig\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Verify you have enough free storage space\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Bekreft at du har nok ledig lagringsplass\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "1. Mount your network share first:\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "1. Monter nettverksdelingen først:\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "2. Select 'NET Backup' from the device list\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "2. Velg 'NET Backup' fra enhetslisten\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "3. Choose your mounted network share\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "3. Velg din monterte nettverksdeling\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "A recording is currently running. Please stop the recording before trying to start a flashing."
msgstr "Et opptak kjører for øyeblikket. Stopp opptaket før du prøver å starte en blinking."

